    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Link Shortner helps you generate short links and share any URL on or off your WordPress website.<br />\nWith this plugin, you can:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create short links for posts.</li>\n<li>Share short links on social media, emails, or anywhere online.</li>\n<li>Quickly regenerate links with one click from your WordPress admin.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you’re managing content, marketing campaigns, or just want neat and professional URLs, Link Shortner makes it simple and effective.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>From your WordPress dashboard, go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong>.<br />\nSearch for <strong>Link Shortner</strong>, then click <strong>Install</strong> and <strong>Activate</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Or upload manually:<br />\nUpload the <code>link-shortner</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory and activate it from the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20generate%20a%20short%20link%3F'>\nHow do I generate a short link?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>After installing Link Shortner, go to the <strong>Posts</strong> section.<br />\nThere you’ll see a <strong>Regenerate Link</strong> button that creates a short URL for your post.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Small improvements and bug fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Link Shortner allows you to easily create clean, branded short permalink links for your posts custom URL.",
